{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18683","headline":"茅檐下始栽竹 · 柳宗元","name":"茅檐下始栽竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"瘴茅葺爲宇，溽暑常侵肌。\n适有重膇疾，蒸郁宁所宜。\n东邻幸导我，树竹邀凉颸。\n欣然惬吾志，荷锸西岩垂。\n楚壤多怪石，垦凿力已疲。\n江风忽云暮，舆曳还相追。\n萧瑟过极浦，旖旎附幽墀。\n贞根期永固，贻尔寒泉滋。\n夜牕遂不掩，羽扇宁复持。\n清泠集浓露，枕簟凄已知。\n网虫依密叶，晓禽栖逈枝。\n岂伊纷嚣闲，重以心虑怡。\n嘉尔亭亭质，自远弃幽期。\n不见野蔓草，蓊蔚有华姿。\n谅无淩寒色，岂与青山辞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18683.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18683","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}